    Module: 4 Wheeler - Confirm Plan / Add-ons Configuration

    Each test opens the quotes listing for fourWheeler.registrationNumber (config.properties) and
    taps the first quote card's premium button to reach Confirm Plan.

    Eclipse: right-click this file > Run As > TestNG Suite (needs the TestNG plugin)
    Maven:   mvn test "-Dsuite=testng-sprint3-bd2m-767.xml"
    To leave a TC out, comment out its <class> line; to leave a platform out, comment out its <test>.
-->
